{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレッスンだけだったから\n買い物とか行ってきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒトヲタカラもしたよ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあと抹茶ラテ飲んでたら\n近くに座ってた外人さんお二人に\n話しかけられて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ここでは\nジョン(仮)とポール(仮)って名前にしとくね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか言われてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりまレポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田：《え！なんかジョンとポールが話しかけてきてる！》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョン：「(ポールをのことを指差しながら)ry」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポール：「ry」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田：(*^-^*)\n《意味わかんない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7815839/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず何語なんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7815839/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョン：「ry！ry？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポール：「ry！ry！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田：(*^-^*)\n《わかんないけど何か言われてる！とりあえず笑うんだ。ここで日本とどっかの国の友好関係を崩して国際問題にでもなったら中田はこの先どうやって生きていけばいいものか。》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョン：...Speaking English！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田：Σ(゜゜ノ)ノ\n《WAO！！　HELP ME！！》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョン：How old are you?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田："},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7815839/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←放心状態"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョン：twenty..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田：はっ(゜ロ゜)←我に返った\n(指で17を表す)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョンとポール：Oh！Seventeen?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田：Yes！Seventeen！YEAH！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り際には\nジョンとポールには\n満面の笑みでばいばいしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、英語勉強しよっとヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのうどんは何うどん？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n山かけです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今すぐ食べたい物は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nいちごパフェ(*^^*)\nいちご抜きで！←it\nアイドルヲタクには伝わりますかね？(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近あった悲しいことは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n自分の英語力の乏しさ！←それな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7815839/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずかわええ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7815839/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"wwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}